"Create a named team of background workers with one unique role each and a shared objective, working in one filesystem. Members (pi or claude-code) get team tools: team_msg (message a teammate by role; queued in its inbox and listed when it wakes), team_inbox (open and close its own items), team_ask (a question to the team's coordinator; the coordinator's own questions reach you as team-question messages, read after your current step, ending any agent_wait, or starting your turn when idle; answer with agent_steer). Every team gets a coordinator and a monitor from Sova, so name only the workers who do the work: the coordinator (first) routes the team and is the only member that reaches you, and the monitor (last) watches context and usage; each team runs 2 more workers than you name, so small independent jobs are cheaper as separate workers (agent_spawn). Only the coordinator sees teammates' tasks, so say in each member's prompt who it works with and on what. No member can spawn, add or stop workers. Starts all members through the same path as agent_spawn (validated before any start, rolled back together on failure) and returns exact worker IDs without waiting. Members default to the pi backend unless defaults.backend or the member sets another. Limits: no per-request limit. A team seats 24 members, the coordinator and monitor Sova adds included. This chat runs at most 24 workers at once, idle ones and every team member (coordinator and monitor included) counted; a request that would pass either is refused before anything starts, and Sova never stops a worker to make room. members must be a list of member objects (one role each). A member takes role, prompt, ownedPaths, backend, model, effort, tools, mcpServers, systemPrompt, cwd, wake, backendOptions, extensions (extensions e.g. [\"npm:pi-web-access\"]); count, fork, agentType and any other setting are refused (one member per role; agent_spawn for fork or agentType). Only the coordinator hands a member over to a successor (its team_succeed); once no coordinator is live, the main chat can start a replacement with team_succeed."
